{
  "translations": [
    {
      "id": "E6320",
      "en": "\"Their face is full of exhaustion too.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6321",
      "en": "Will we make it back aboveground alive?\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6322",
      "en": "The ink was faded and difficult to read...",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6323",
      "en": "\"How long has it been since I was left alone?",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6324",
      "en": "My breathing is ragged, but even I can tell",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6325",
      "en": "that it is growing weaker.\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6326",
      "en": "\"How much longer can I last...?\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6327",
      "en": "\"I can't go on...\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6328",
      "en": "Only those words were written there.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6329",
      "en": "There was nothing else.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6330",
      "en": "At your feet lay a tightly crumpled scrap of paper.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6331",
      "en": "Without much thought, you unfolded it and looked inside.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6332",
      "en": "Nothing was written on the scrap of paper.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6333",
      "en": "Words were written on the wall...",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6334",
      "en": "\"I've made it to the third basement level.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6335",
      "en": "I don't know left from right,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6336",
      "en": "but all I can do is keep walking.\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6337",
      "en": "A string of numbers had also been written there,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6338",
      "en": "but you did not know what they meant.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6339",
      "en": "The letters were so small",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6340",
      "en": "that you would never have noticed without looking carefully.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6341",
      "en": "\"John's stopped talking altogether.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6342",
      "en": "Come to think of it, John did say",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6343",
      "en": "even talking takes energy.\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6344",
      "en": "\"Some food should help restore their strength.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6345",
      "en": "How much bread did we have left?\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6346",
      "en": "\"Well, once we're aboveground,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6347",
      "en": "we can eat all we want.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6348",
      "en": "We just have to hold on a little longer.\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6349",
      "en": "A scrap of paper lay on the ground...",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6350",
      "en": "\"I haven't eaten anything for three days...\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6351",
      "en": "\"When will I ever get out of this darkness?\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6352",
      "en": "\"It was time to change watch.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6353",
      "en": "I called to my companion, who lay beside me sleeping like the dead,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6354",
      "en": "probably from exhaustion.\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6355",
      "en": "\"I never imagined they really were dead!",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6356",
      "en": "My hands shook,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6357",
      "en": "and I could not make them stop...\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6358",
      "en": "A sign hung from the ceiling.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6359",
      "en": "\"The moment you give up is the moment it ends.\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6360",
      "en": "At a sudden cracking sound,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6361",
      "en": "you hurriedly looked around.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6362",
      "en": "You had merely stepped on a piece of firewood.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6363",
      "en": "\"There is no turning back now.\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6364",
      "en": "\"If you never begin, you will never even reach an end.\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6365",
      "en": "A sign stood there...",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6366",
      "en": "\"Here Lies Smith.\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6367",
      "en": "It seemed to be a grave marker rather than a sign.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6368",
      "en": "A gentle voice came from nowhere...",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6369",
      "en": "\"Have you begun to appreciate the sun?\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6370",
      "en": "The mysterious voice quietly faded away.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6371",
      "en": "A quiet voice rang out.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6372",
      "en": "\"You must not only hurry onward,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6373",
      "en": "but also take time to rest.\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6374",
      "en": "The voice faded away...",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6375",
      "en": "Words were written on the wall",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6376",
      "en": "in trembling handwriting.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6377",
      "en": "\"Calm down!",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6378",
      "en": "Calm down!!\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6379",
      "en": "Suddenly, a voice began to speak.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6380",
      "en": "It did not reach you through your ears,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6381",
      "en": "but echoed directly inside your head...",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6382",
      "en": "\"Answer my question...\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6383",
      "en": "\"What creature walks on four legs in the morning,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6384",
      "en": "two at noon, and three at night...?\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6385",
      "en": "A human",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6386",
      "en": "A dragon",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6387",
      "en": "\"Yes, that is correct...\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6388",
      "en": "\"Foolish...\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6389",
      "en": "\"What is something whose presence or absence",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6390",
      "en": "matters little to you,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6391",
      "en": "but is necessary to others...?\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6392",
      "en": "The sea",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6393",
      "en": "A name",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6394",
      "en": "\"What can you see when your eyes are closed,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6395",
      "en": "but cannot see when your eyes are open...?\"",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6396",
      "en": "A fragment",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6397",
      "en": "A dream",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6398",
      "en": "You heard a voice.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "E6399",
      "en": "It was that voice echoing directly inside your head.",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": ""
    }
  ],
